     - watch      — a hand stepping round a dial with a crown and four ticks
     - record     — a grooved disc turning, the label in the style's file blue
     - metronome  — an arm with its weight swinging over a tapered case
     - telegraph  — dash, dot, dash, dot punched along a ruled tape
